---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="IRS W-9 Form (2024) Template | usignpdf"
  seo={{
    page_description: "Download a free PDF template for the IRS W-9 form, ready to be filled out and signed electronically.",
    canonical_url: "https://usignpdf.com/templates/w9/"
  }}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose max-w-none">
    <a href="/templates" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Templates</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">IRS W-9 Form Template</h1>

    <p>The W-9 form is used by US businesses to request the Taxpayer Identification Number (TIN) of a contractor or freelancer. If you are doing <a href="/use-cases/freelancers">freelance work</a>, you will likely be asked to provide one of these.</p>

    <div class="bg-surface-alt p-6 border border-border rounded my-8 flex justify-between items-center not-prose">
        <span class="font-bold">IRS W-9 Form (PDF)</span>
        <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent text-surface rounded hover:bg-accent-hover font-semibold">Download PDF</a>
    </div>

    <h2>Can I sign a W-9 electronically?</h2>
    <p>Yes. The IRS permits the electronic signing of Form W-9, provided the platform securely records the signature and the signer's identity. By using usignpdf, the resulting <a href="/security/audit-trails">Audit Trail</a> easily satisfies these IRS requirements, ensuring full <a href="/compliance">compliance</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
